  "version": "1.0.0",
  "category": "scoring_engine",
  "description": "Machine-readable lookup tables for the AI Wardrobe Stylist outfit scoring engine. Contains color pair compatibility, style-to-occasion mappings, footwear rules, pattern constraints, season-material mappings, fit combination rules, garment type taxonomy, and XGBoost feature scoring weights. This file is consumed directly by the Outfit_Scorer feature pipeline — do not use it for human-readable rule display.",
